Error [E0302]: fact read `@range` is compile-time only
  --> tests/ui/fact_read_runtime.jet:4:20
    |
  4 |     print(Severity.@range.start)
    |                    ^^^^^^
 Why: a fact is a value known before code generation; it never selects runtime behavior
 Fix: move the read into an `@` binding or a compile-time block
